  "name": "DeepSeek",
  "label": "DeepSeek",
  "description": "Official DeepSeek Chat Completions on the v2 agent model contract (INPUT llm_input → OUTPUT llm_output). operation selects chat (POST /chat/completions) or list_models (GET /models). There is no reason RPC — thinking is a chat body (thinking + reasoning_effort) on deepseek-v4-flash / deepseek-v4-pro / deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp. Catalog reason is dropped. Legacy deepseek-reasoner / deepseek-chat were discontinued 2026-07-24. Auth is StudioQuack secret api_key sent as Bearer. Docs: https://api-docs.deepseek.com/. Terms: https://cdn.deepseek.com/policies/en-US/deepseek-open-platform-terms-of-service.html. Never log api_key.",
  "icon": "psychology",
